# Restart test, phase 2: read the restart written by in.reverse_restart1 and
# continue the frozen reservoir.  The collide/react/fix commands are not saved
# in a restart and are re-issued here; the detailed-balance reverse tables and
# any Keq fits are rebuilt deterministically at react init, and the per-particle
# electronic state (elecstate/eelec) is restored by fix elecmode.  The continued
# run must hold the same detailed balance as an uninterrupted run.
# Variables: T, NRHO, FNUM.

read_restart    reverse.restart
seed            54321

collide         vss air air.vss relax constant
collide_modify  rotate discrete vibrate discrete electronic discrete
fix             electronic elecmode
collide_modify  remain no

react           tce rev.tce
react_modify    partial_energy no compute_chem_rates yes rboost 1000.0

timestep        1.00E-9
run             6000
